  "source_text": "Medal of Honor of the National Guard Médaille d’honneur de la Garde Nationale Medal instituted in 1966. Medal awarded to officers of the National Guard for 10 years of excellent service. On 29 March 1985, the medal was divided into two classes: second class (for 10 years of service) and first class (for 8 years of service). Republic of Tunisia",
